#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Imwe chete face modhi yakanyoreswa. Kuvhenekera kunoshandura kuti chiso "
"chako chinotaridzika sei kune kamera, saka imwe modhi inogona kutadza "
"manheru pasi pemarambi (kana masikati). Wedzera yechipiri modhi yakanyorwa "
"muchiedza chakasiyana kuti urambe uchivhura yakavimbika chero nguva yezuva."

